      <p>Apex Financial Services Ltd. (AFSL) is a systemically important non-banking financial company (NBFC) that aggressively expanded its balance sheet by funding long-term real estate construction loans (average maturity 7 years) using short-term commercial paper and 90-day inter-corporate deposits. When real estate developers experienced sales slowdowns, AFSL faced sudden payment delays.</p>
