          <li><strong>Flaw of Constant Discount Rate:</strong> When technological, commercial, or regulatory risk is front-loaded and drops off once commercialization is achieved, continuing to apply a high compounding RADR heavily distorts the economic value of mature cash flows. In competitive bids or mergers and acquisitions, such an error causes management to under-bid or reject highly profitable investments.</li>
