        <p><strong>Managerial Insight:</strong> Management must execute <strong>Option B (Test Marketing)</strong>. By spending ₹5,00,000 on test marketing, the firm buys a valuable "real option to abandon", eliminating the catastrophic ₹80,00,000 loss exposure under market failure and converting an unprofitable venture into a value-creating project.</p>
