                  <li><em>Alternative 1.2 (Continue at Current Capacity):</em> Invest ₹0 at $t = 1$. Annual cash inflows in Years 2 and 3 will be: High Demand of ₹38,00,000 p.a. (Probability = 0.80) or Normal Demand of ₹25,00,000 p.a. (Probability = 0.20).</li>
