      <div class="question-container">
        <p class="question-intro"><strong>Question 1 (Theory - 4 Marks):</strong></p>
        <p>Fundamental analysis operates on the premise that an equity security possesses an intrinsic true value determined by economic realities.</p>
        <p>You are required to:</p>
        <ol type="a">
          <li>Explain the top-down <strong>"Economy-Industry-Company (EIC)"</strong> analytical framework.</li>
          <li>Describe the three primary forecasting techniques utilized in macroeconomic analysis:
            <ol type="i">
              <li>Barometric / Economic Indicator Approach (Leading, Coincident, and Lagging indicators);</li>
              <li>Econometric Model Building Approach; and</li>
              <li>Opportunistic Model Building Approach.</li>
            </ol>
          </li>
        </ol>
      </div>
