          <li>Formulate price target projections for the terminal peak of <strong>Wave 5</strong> using the two standard Elliott Wave Fibonacci guidelines:
            <ol type="i">
              <li><em>Guideline A:</em> Wave 5 equals the length of Wave 1;</li>
              <li><em>Guideline B:</em> Wave 5 equals 0.618 times the entire net distance travelled from the start of Wave 1 to the end of Wave 3, projected from the termination of Wave 4.</li>
            </ol>
          </li>
