          <li><strong>Preference Share Beta:</strong> The treasury should <strong>REJECT / AVOID</strong> Preference Share Beta. It is overpriced at ₹95.00 against its fundamental worth of ₹91.67 and provides a sub-par current yield of only <strong>11.58%</strong>.</li>
