        <p>A Chartered Accountant registered as a <strong>Registered Valuer (Securities or Financial Assets)</strong> under Section 247 of the Companies Act, 2013 is approached by the board of directors of a fast-growing unlisted fintech unicorn to conduct an independent equity business valuation for an impending cross-border acquisition.</p>
